      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "§43. 根据向量的坐标计算向量的长和两个向量的夹角"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题1. 求向量 $\\vec a=(x,y,z)$（图3）的长."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解. 利用数性积的坐标公式（§42），得到：$\\vec a\\cdot\\vec a=xx+yy↵+zz$，即 $\\vec a^2=x^2+y^2+z^2$，因此，$|\\vec a|=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2+z^2}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 3",
      "box": [
        209,
        842,
        343,
        321
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-03"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "图3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 4",
      "box": [
        799,
        840,
        347,
        331
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-04"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 4",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由此可见，向量的长度等于它的坐标的平方和的平方根."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题2. 求两个非零向量 $\\vec a=(x_1,y_1,z_1)$ 和 $\\vec b=(x_2,y_2,z_2)$",
        "的夹角 $\\varphi$（图4）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解. 从两个向量的数性积的定义得到，$\\cos\\varphi=\\frac{\\vec a\\cdot\\vec b}{|\\vec a|\\cdot|\\vec b|}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "但是 $\\vec a\\cdot\\vec b=x_1x_2+y_1y_2+z_1z_2$（§42）；$|\\vec a|=\\sqrt{x_1^2+y_1^2+z_1^2}$，$|\\vec b|↵=\\sqrt{x_2^2+y_2^2+z_2^2}$（问题1）. 于是"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\cos\\varphi=\\frac{x_1x_2+y_1y_2+z_1z_2}{\\sqrt{x_1^2+y_1^2+z_1^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{x_2^2+y_2^2+z_2^2}}$."
      ]
    },
